    "analysis": "Hypit gives coding agents (Claude Code, Codex) a markup language (SVML), compiler and runtime for building videos as editable, re-runnable workflows. Given a reference video, an agent clones it as footage, word-anchored captions, B-roll and effects, then swaps faces, scripts or products to render many variants via headless Chromium and ffmpeg. It ships as an installable agent skill and Node CLI in a TypeScript monorepo with a plugin system and pluggable model providers, aimed at marketers and creators producing ads, UGC and short-form clips.",
